  "text": "A notable subgroup of gnomes called umbral gnomes typically have gray or brown skin with a stony texture, and thin, pale hair or bald pates. Umbral gnomes are most numerous in the Darklands, where they go by the name drathnelar. While they are not as sinister or ruthless as other Darklands denizens, those who seek their aid should remember that they don't welcome strangers with open arms.\n\nUmbral gnome rockwardens follow druidic teachings and commune with the natural elemental influences and denizens of the Darklands."
